# Every train's first boot: hdesk at 1920 x 1080 and 512 MiB, no volume; the desk's first shell; Super+Shift+Q
# twice shuts down (FF-R6 B). A state pool fault ends the boot before the desk (guest.py pool reads it).
hdesk: screen 1920x1080 plane 1920x
hdesk: bar desktop 1 |Console| var |/|
hdesk: ff armed 3
daphnis: shut down
daphnis: done
